                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was almost a perfectly mediocre game. I, for one, even experienced brief flashes of enjoyment from conquering particularly difficult levels. I could have forgiven the brutal level design. I could have forgiven Game Gear graphics. I could have forgiven minor glitchiness. I could have forgiven public domain music from Grandma's mahjong tablet apps. But I can't forgive clearing 12 tough as nails levels only to die on the first boss and be sent all the way back to Stage 1-1. This might be the single most artificially difficult and insulting thing a developer has ever done to make money on Steam and run. I would not recommend this game if it were free.",
